msgstr "**تحديد الدخل السنوي الخاضع للضريبة للموظف**:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1175
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1495
msgid ""
"Compute the annualized salary, including benefits in kind (e.g., company "
