#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1218
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1538
msgid ""
"A withholding tax exemption is granted when the normal annual gross income "
"does not exceed a specific threshold, which is determined based on the "
"number of dependent children [2]."
msgstr ""
"يُمنح إعفاء من ضريبة الاستقطاع عندما لا يتجاوز الدخل الإجمالي السنوي العادي "
