#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1555
msgid ""
"The amount of this exemption corresponds to the difference between the "
"annual gross income and the threshold amount."
msgstr ""
"يتوافق مقدار هذا الإعفاء مع الفرق بين الدخل الإجمالي السنوي ومبلغ العتبة."

