msgstr "تعرض الصفحة التالية نفس المعلومات ربعًا بربع وملخصة للعام بأكمله."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1957
msgid "Individual Account PDF Quarter by Quarter."
msgstr "PDF للحساب الفردي ربعًا بربع."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:1960
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3101
#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/belgium.rst:3171
msgid ""
"Once all PDF files are generated, they can be posted to the employee "
"documents portal if the **Documents** application is :doc:`installed and "
