"العمل الأردني."

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:31
msgid ":guilabel:`Jordan - Payroll with Accounting`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`الأردن - كشوف المرتبات مع المحاسبة`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/jordan.rst:32
